-### 2.7 P1 — Account Switch Pending Flush, Logout Backup Truthfulness, Sync Concurrency & Stroke Merge Signatures
-- **Root Cause:**
-  1. `handleAuthSessionChange()` wiped `pendingAnnoSaveMap = {}` on account switch without flushing pending strokes for the outgoing user.
-  2. `pullWorkspaceFromCloud()` and `syncWorkspaceOnLogin()` looked up `pharmaAccountWorkspace_${currentCloudUser.email || currentCloudUser.id}` while `pushWorkspaceToCloud()` and `handleCloudSignOut()` saved under `pharmaAccountWorkspace_${canonicalUid}`.
-  3. `handleCloudSignOut()` reported backup success even if reading annotations or writing `localStorage` failed.
-  4. `pushWorkspaceToCloud()` used a single global `isCloudSyncing` flag and cleared `pharmaWorkspaceDirty` unconditionally on completion even if new local edits occurred during the network request.
-  5. `visibilitychange` did not `await flushPendingAnnotationsSave()` before calling `pushWorkspaceToCloud()`.
-  6. `mergeAndApplyCloudConflict()` deduplicated strokes using `${s.tool}:${s.color}:${(s.points||[]).length}`, causing false deduplication of distinct strokes with the same tool, color, and point count.
-- **Affected Functions & Line Numbers (`index.html`):**
-  - `getAccountBackupStorageKey()` (`index.html:19381`)
-  - `handleAuthSessionChange()` (`index.html:26071`)
-  - `handleCloudSignOut()` (`index.html:28825`)
-  - `computeStrokeUniqueSignature()` (`index.html:29266`)
-  - `mergeAndApplyCloudConflict()` (`index.html:29289`)
-  - `markLocalWorkspaceModified()` (`index.html:29521`)
-  - `pushWorkspaceToCloud()` (`index.html:29541`)
-  - `visibilitychange` listener (`index.html:30117`)
+### 3.7 P1 — Account Switch Pending Flush, Logout Backup Truthfulness, Sync Concurrency & Stroke Merge Signatures
 - **Remediation:**
   - `handleAuthSessionChange()` flushes `pendingAnnoSaveMap` under the outgoing user's `AccountOperationContext` before switching (and isolates any unflushable entries in `isolatedPendingAnnotationsByUser[prevUid]`).
   - Unified all per-account backup reads and writes to `getAccountBackupStorageKey(uid)` (`pharmaAccountWorkspace_${canonicalUid}`).
   - `handleCloudSignOut()` checks `annoRes.ok` and `localStorage.setItem` success, setting `backupSuccess: false` and preserving dirty flags if either fails.
-  - Added per-account sync tracking (`activeCloudSyncByAccount`) and mutation sequence counters (`localWorkspaceMutationSeq`, `localAnnotationsMutationSeq`) so finishing syncs only clear dirty/sync flags if `opCtx.isCurrent()` and no newer edits occurred during the network call.
+  - Added per-account sync tracking (`activeCloudSyncByAccount`) and mutation sequence counters (`workspaceMutationSeq`, `annotationMutationSeq`) so finishing syncs only clear dirty/sync flags if `opCtx.isCurrent()` and no newer edits occurred during the network call.
   - `visibilitychange` awaits `flushPendingAnnotationsSave(false, visCtx)` before calling `pushWorkspaceToCloud()`.
   - `computeStrokeUniqueSignature()` incorporates stroke ID, tool, color, width/size, opacity, text, and all point coordinates.
